---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { DISCORD_URL } from '../lib/config';
---
<BaseLayout title="Choosing and Maintaining Plugins - Open WP Club" description="Learn how we select starter plugins, what to check before installing, and where to get help maintaining your site.">
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Choosing and Maintaining Plugins' }]} />
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-950"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-10">
    <div><p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">Selection and support</p><h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Choose with confidence. Keep your site healthy.</h1><p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">A useful plugin should solve a specific problem and fit the site it runs on. Here's how to evaluate one and where to turn when you need a hand.</p></div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5"><section class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 sm:p-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">How we choose starters</h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Our starter list is hand-picked around common jobs, such as managing orders or finding users. We look for a clear purpose, an available installation and documentation that helps you get started. We revisit the selection as projects change.</p><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">A recommendation is a starting point, not a guarantee that a plugin fits every site. Check the current project details and test it with your own setup.</p><a href="/start-here/" class="mt-5 inline-block font-medium text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">See the starter selection →</a></section>
    <section class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 sm:p-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">What to check</h2><ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400"><li><strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Purpose:</strong> Read the description and README to see what the plugin actually does.</li><li><strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Requirements:</strong> Check declared WordPress, PHP and, where relevant, WooCommerce versions. Missing declarations do not confirm compatibility.</li><li><strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Project activity:</strong> Review releases, issues and repository activity for context; activity alone is not a support guarantee.</li></ul></section></div>
    <section class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 sm:p-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Maintain and troubleshoot</h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Keep a current backup, test updates on a staging site and check the result before updating production. If you find a problem, note the steps to reproduce it, what you expected and what happened. Include the plugin, WordPress, PHP and relevant WooCommerce versions; remove private customer data and credentials.</p><div class="mt-6 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2"><div><h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Ask the community</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">For questions and help reproducing an issue, talk with other users in Discord.</p><a href={DISCORD_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-3 inline-block text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">Join Discord →</a></div><div><h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Report a plugin issue</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Open the relevant plugin page and follow its GitHub link to report the problem in that project's issues.</p><a href="/plugins/" class="mt-3 inline-block text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">Find your plugin →</a></div></div><p class="mt-6 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Need hands-on help with setup or maintenance? See our <a href="/services/" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">services</a> for the available paid options.</p></section>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
